    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e749a72849a8eeee69f9343",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……否ッ！　あと1箇所ッ！\nいつも、たづなと2人で行く場所があってな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76ad03965f69480b740d2227784649f42667ac9f66a0f8c0070cbd8bd54083e3",
